 <39159422+bilacc@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 07:05:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: google: gs101-oriole: add soc_id and
 bootargs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Oriole boots through the same ABL as raven, so it needs the same two
board properties raven got with the gs101 bootloader glue; the shared
part of that change (dpm stubs, watchdog_cl1, -@) already covers it.

- soc_id, which ABL matches the base DTB on. Google's oriole factory
  image (oriole-cp3a.261005.002.a1) ships two base DTBs in vendor_boot,
  with soc_id <0x9845000 0x00> and <0x9845001 0x00>. Build with the B0
  value, as raven does; the image tooling writes the A0 copy from this
  one. Without a soc_id the tooling refuses the oriole DTB.
- /chosen/bootargs with panic=10, since ABL appends console=null and a
  panic would otherwise hang silently.

Both hunks match raven's board file line for line.

Assisted-by: claude-opus-5-5 dt-validate checkpatch
Signed-off-by: Josip Bilać <39159422+bilacc@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-oriole.dts | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-oriole.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-oriole.dts
index c5a3958c2..28a567fc0 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-oriole.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-oriole.dts
@@ -14,6 +14,21 @@
 / {
 	model = "Oriole";
 	compatible = "google,gs101-oriole", "google,gs101";
+
+	/*
+	 * ABL picks the base DTB by soc_id (product id 0x09845000 | major
+	 * revision); the factory vendor_boot carries one per revision. B0 = 1.
+	 */
+	soc_id = <0x09845001 0x0>;
+
+	chosen {
+		/*
+		 * ABL appends its own arguments (console=null among them), so a
+		 * panic is silent: panic=10 reboots instead of hanging. init hands
+		 * over to the Arch root on userdata when it finds one.
+		 */
+		bootargs = "console=tty0 panic=10 clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused rdinit=/init";
+	};
 };
 
 &acpm_ipc {
